{"id": "DehE-_JgO46", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Your phone and charger have a conversation before fast charging starts. 🔌\n\nThe charger starts at a safe 5 V, then lists what it can do over a dedicated wire in the USB-C cable: 9, 15, 20 volts. The phone picks one. More volts = more power through the same thin cable without the heat. 20 V × 5 A = 100 W, but only if the cable has a tiny e-marker chip inside.\n\nSave this before you buy your next cable.\n\n#usbc #fastcharging #techexplained #howtechworks #gadgets", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792135806, "like_count": 2, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18140395744575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.371, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPYfxB_26pUeWR7j7QRMEnZtJA7LplsRKCJ2TU6B22mVJs2ATIkB7IJ8hjv84SL9yXaxSnuZvMDmI2xq-Ggxx9cgzQm8NWb1sGuk_I.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=AdoRmDOQY_e_UeN_0nqVwVIZs_UgEtDH6OxmqBw2c_IqvmgsNbhvsC4zoJb4kDXrRXXP6fYTfg3MflfXio3_gIT8&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=EUqcGT2g5HoQ7kNvwEhiclO&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=2SzfjbwRFsuABHbRRhG_Ww&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQJxWE5rlCkHpV8BOKJ7kSpTebHNz2YoB93ELX5cORMpA&oe=6AF42CC4", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 65.371, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-18140